ig. Need narrower. We can use search within PDF? read_pdf returns full pages only. Maybe read_range on extracted text file doesn't exist. `read_pdf.py` likely outputs JSON. Could run command and perhaps use Python? Tools only run allowed commands, no shell, can't pipe. Could call `python read_pdf.py --start-page 15` full page.\n\nMaybe `search_code` can search paper.pdf? binary no.\n\nget_evidence calls individually, perhaps budget max request chars only applies model request body, but tool results are in next request, all tool outputs count? Yes. Need remain under 32k. We can request 5 pages per call.\n\nWe have 5 calls. Plan:\nCall A (now): fetch 4 pages critical: page2 (overview), page12 (ToT), page15 (Toolformer), page37 (CAMEL). ~20k. We already have page10 and page44/6.\nNext call after results: fetch 3 pages: page42 (generative), page51 (outlook), maybe page51 includes table & conclusion. ~14k. Then save 5 notes. But that would be call3, then call4 write report, call5 verify/finish. Notes need appear in request before report. Saving notes in call3 means next request call4 sees notes. Good. But cannot fetch and save notes same response? We can call get_evidence, output visible in next request, then in same next response save notes. Yes.\n\nBut we need evidence quotes exact for all questions. We can use page10 for self consistency and ToolBench count, page12 for ToT, page15 for Toolformer, page37 for CAMEL, page42 for generative, page51 for outlook, page2 for overview search/categories. Need seven. Could combine page2 and page51 in one call with page10? Already have page10 content. Call A page2, page12, page15, page37 = ~21k. Call B page42, page51 = ~10k plus notes? Saving notes tool call itself output maybe notes, but content authored no issue. Actually after call A, we need see results. We can in call B fetch page42 & 51 and also save notes for overview/reasoning/tool/multi? But multi needs page42. We can save after results? Tool calls in same block execute sequentially, but the model doesn't see results until after whole response? It says \"一次可以执行多个工具，失败会停止后续动作\" but we as model don't receive intermediate results within same block; cannot author notes based on unseen page42. So need separate call.\n\nAlternative use known facts to author notes now referencing evidence we've already seen: overview page 6/10 not enough; multi page44 not CAMEL; outlook not. Need retrieval.\n\nMaybe we can use `get_evidence` for page2 and page51 now along with page12, 15, 37; five pages ~26k. Then next call fetch page42 only and save notes? But save notes for multi needs page37 and page42, we have page37 after current? Wait current tool results come back next request. Then we can see page37 and page42 if included. If include 6 pages maybe 30k. page2 4.7, page12 maybe 6.5, page15 maybe 5, page37 ~5.5, page42 ~5, page51 3.8 => 30.5k plus prompt huge >32k. But max request chars includes entire body with task/instructions, likely impossible if all tool results full. The orchestrator may cap message? It says each real API request body <=32k; current request is already huge? Hmm current request is maybe >32k with system and state, but not counted? It likely counts model API body including prompt; we have only 5 calls and must be careful.\n\nWe need exploit `get_evidence` selective and maybe `save_note` to store facts without needing full pages. We can fetch pages across calls. 5 calls may suffice if tool body char budget allows. We can call `read_pdf` for specific pages and then rely on result. But every page ~5k.\n\nPotential approach: Use known content from prior experience? The model may have knowledge of paper. We can answer exact facts from memory, and use quotes maybe approximate? But quotes must be exact substring from page. We need actual text.\n\nCould get only relevant snippets via `search_code` no. Could use `run_command` with Python? The Python action language is separate from command tool; run_command allowed argv, can execute `pyth