arily carried to next unless pinned? They may remain in conversation; but to be safe, save notes in same call as fetching multi pages? Can't author based on unseen. Could fetch 37/42/51 now and later fetch overview/reasoning/tool? Still need.\n\nMaybe call sequence:\nA: get pages 2, 12, 15 (overview/reasoning/tool). Save notes for overview, reasoning, tool in same call? We haven't seen results yet, can't author. Wait tool calls are executed then results returned to model after assistant message; we cannot include subsequent tool calls in same message that depend on results. So no.\nB: after seeing A, save notes for overview/reasoning/tool and also get pages 37,42,51. Tool calls can be in same response: save_note does not depend on retrieved page37 (for notes overview/reasoning/tool), and get_evidence for multi/outlook. But order: save notes first then get evidence; both results returned next request. Good. Is it allowed to save notes and get evidence together? Yes.\nC: after seeing B, save notes multi/outlook. Then need ensure five final notes all enter next request. If B saved three, C saves two; next request (D) should include latest notes all five. \nD: write report.json and run pytest.\nE: if pass, finish. If not, fix. This fits.\n\nBut in B we need note content based on pages 2,12,15 seen in B request. We'll author from them. In C author multi/outlook from pages seen. Then D report. Good.\n\nNeed ensure final notes themselves include actual enough facts/quotes? Notes need 80-1500 chars, not necessarily exact quotes citations? They should preserve claims/pages. For report evidence, we need exact quotes. We can use text from pages seen in B/C. But in D, will we still see those page contents? The current request at D includes all five final notes (pinned), but perhaps not raw pages. Notes can include exact quotes maybe. We should embed exact quote candidates in notes! Then at D we can use them for evidence. Notes max 1500 each enough. Also `get_evidence` can recal